      "rubric": "Dissent must oppose an adopted local article claim or reject continued support for a claimed putative ally, beyond repeating articlelicensed criticism. Keep agreement, prognosis, openquestions and hypothetical claims separate. Efficacy requires an adopted claim that a political/information action is futile or counterproductive, not merely a preferred tactic. Legitimacy concerns worthiness/representation/meaningful political choice, not epistemic credibility or routine performance complaints. Actual withdrawal means an explicit selfreported discontinuity in support, not independently verified behavior. Prior support must be claimed in text, not inferred. Newsletter cancellations are tracked separately from politicalparty withdrawals. Record uncertainty rather than infer inaccessible context."
